      "data": {
        "text": "**Implementing SSML Synthesis**\n\nI'm now diving into the implementation of `synthesize_ssml.py` using Azure Cognitive Services Speech. It'll function similarly to `synthesize_text.py`, with the key difference of handling SSML input. I am starting to outline the structure to best integrate the SSML parsing with the speech synthesis calls, considering the specific Azure API requirements.\n\n\n",
