      "data": {
        "text": "**Listing Voice Options**\n\nOkay, I'm now focused on the `select_voice.py` file. My goal is to use the Azure SDK to identify and choose an appropriate voice for a given locale. I plan to use the Azure SDK's voice retrieval functions.\n\n\n",
